WEBVTT

00:00:01.381 --> 00:00:13.259
Yes, I embraced tenderness and devotion
sou itooshisa to kizuna wo daita

00:00:13.393 --> 00:00:18.956
Floating in unending space
hatenaki umi ni ukabu

00:00:18.999 --> 00:00:25.905
On this small planet
chiisa na hoshi de

00:00:26.406 --> 00:00:37.442
When I feel your warmth next to me
anata no nukumori wo soba ni kanjiru toki

00:00:37.617 --> 00:00:43.556
I understand the burden
inochi no omosa to

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:50.962
And the transience of life
hakanasa wo shiru no

00:00:53.734 --> 00:00:58.772
Nights of sorrowful wandering
mayoinageku yoru mo

00:00:58.772 --> 00:01:05.645
And tearful mornings
namida no asa mo

00:01:05.645 --> 00:01:11.251
I believe in tomorrow
ashita wo shinjiru kara

00:01:11.251 --> 00:01:17.524
So I can make it through
koeteyukeru no

00:01:17.524 --> 00:01:25.954
To the continuation of the dream
yume no tsuzuki he

00:01:50.824 --> 00:01:55.761
DUMAS

00:01:56.763 --> 00:01:58.822
Big Sister.

00:02:01.935 --> 00:02:03.835
We're catching up!

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:12.169
-I'm jumping over!
-Thoma!

00:02:17.017 --> 00:02:18.917
Wonder!

00:02:27.294 --> 00:02:29.592
W-Watch out, Thoma!

00:02:31.798 --> 00:02:34.130
Thoma! Use this!

00:02:35.902 --> 00:02:37.893
Hurry up!

00:02:38.472 --> 00:02:41.134
Thoma!

00:02:48.982 --> 00:02:50.283
You did it.

00:02:50.283 --> 00:02:52.652
Where's Helga?!
We've lost sight of Helga!

00:02:52.652 --> 00:02:54.711
Hasmodye is going after them!

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:07.391
The... The Children of Befort?

00:03:09.836 --> 00:03:11.929
What's the matter, Cooks?

00:03:13.607 --> 00:03:15.642
These children?

00:03:15.642 --> 00:03:18.008
They were in that picture.

00:03:24.951 --> 00:03:28.114
W-Wait! Ian! Flo!

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:33.560
S-Six years ago, you disappeared.

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:37.797
You're Flo from Nohedge and
Ian from Sanceli Island, right?

00:03:37.797 --> 00:03:42.359
I-I've been looking for you
for a very long time.

00:03:51.344 --> 00:03:55.181
Th-The children in this
100 year-old picture...

00:03:55.181 --> 00:03:57.172
They are you, aren't they?

00:04:04.324 --> 00:04:08.624
That was the time...
Bob Cooks took that picture.

00:04:16.436 --> 00:04:18.199
Soreto!

00:04:18.872 --> 00:04:22.171
W-Wait! Please wait!

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:26.513
Don't go! Please don't go away!

00:04:26.513 --> 00:04:28.674
Cooks!

00:04:34.621 --> 00:04:38.113
Cooks... How could you
shoot at children?

00:04:49.135 --> 00:04:50.830
Cooks...

00:04:53.340 --> 00:04:58.334
H-He called my grandfather's name...

00:05:07.053 --> 00:05:09.322
Darn it! Did we lose them?

00:05:09.322 --> 00:05:11.291
They must be on the
bottom of the ocean.

00:05:11.291 --> 00:05:13.293
If they're hiding a ship from Greecia.

00:05:13.293 --> 00:05:16.363
-A ship?
-A spaceship, most likely.

00:05:16.363 --> 00:05:18.524
A spaceship?!

00:05:19.299 --> 00:05:22.202
In that case, hurry up and dive in!
You're an alien, right?

00:05:22.202 --> 00:05:24.337
How am I supposed to dive
to the ocean floor?

00:05:24.337 --> 00:05:26.999
Besides, Wonder can't make it
to the ocean depths.

00:05:27.207 --> 00:05:29.072
It's Hasmodye!

00:05:29.376 --> 00:05:30.610
Hasmodye!

00:05:30.610 --> 00:05:33.408
Tarlant! This way! Hurry!

00:05:55.035 --> 00:05:56.559
It's pitch black!

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:12.977
Do you remember this?

00:06:14.954 --> 00:06:17.787
It was made to look just like
the palace gardens.

00:06:23.496 --> 00:06:25.726
Come, Big Sister.

00:06:29.069 --> 00:06:32.197
I beg of you. Please let me go.

00:06:50.724 --> 00:06:52.759
Big Sister...

00:06:52.759 --> 00:06:56.855
Do you know how long...
I've waited for this day?

00:06:57.163 --> 00:06:59.999
How much I've wanted to see you?

00:06:59.999 --> 00:07:02.194
Don't you understand?

00:07:02.635 --> 00:07:04.337
Always...

00:07:04.337 --> 00:07:08.171
I've always been thinking
only of you, Big Sister.

00:07:13.246 --> 00:07:15.077
I beg of you...

00:07:18.885 --> 00:07:20.716
Dumas...

00:07:41.407 --> 00:07:43.977
Hasmodye!
Did they really go this way?

00:07:43.977 --> 00:07:46.679
There's a shaft! I chased them
all the way to a deep shaft!

00:07:46.679 --> 00:07:48.408
Thoma!

00:07:50.550 --> 00:07:51.949
That was dangerous, Wonder!

00:07:55.255 --> 00:07:57.246
The sound of water.

00:08:03.663 --> 00:08:05.528
It's a waterfall.

00:08:09.435 --> 00:08:10.959
Big Sister.

00:08:13.306 --> 00:08:15.934
This is your true form.

00:08:30.123 --> 00:08:32.148
Tina.

00:08:56.716 --> 00:09:00.652
Our mother... passed
away on this ship.

00:09:02.422 --> 00:09:07.026
When I was three years old, we
were forced to flee from Greecia.

00:09:07.026 --> 00:09:11.297
Until she passed away when I was
five years old, I saw my mother...

00:09:11.297 --> 00:09:14.164
...only once.

00:09:15.501 --> 00:09:18.026
Only once.

00:09:34.621 --> 00:09:36.248
Dumas.

00:09:38.057 --> 00:09:43.017
Is it true that if I come to see you,
your illness will get worse?

00:09:43.696 --> 00:09:46.232
That's what your father said, right?

00:09:46.232 --> 00:09:51.761
That's not true. I've wanted to
see you all this time.

00:09:52.639 --> 00:09:54.869
Mother.

00:09:59.946 --> 00:10:02.414
What are you doing?

00:10:05.718 --> 00:10:07.987
What is that look for?

00:10:07.987 --> 00:10:11.980
Reda, do you hate me that much?!

00:10:12.859 --> 00:10:16.095
You did something atrocious to Tina!

00:10:16.095 --> 00:10:21.590
And I realized... that you
didn't love me at all!

00:10:21.834 --> 00:10:25.600
You just wanted to take
everything from King Titus!

00:10:26.406 --> 00:10:28.141
What nonsense!

00:10:28.141 --> 00:10:30.076
No matter how much
you might wish for it,

00:10:30.076 --> 00:10:33.011
I won't let you go back to my brother!

00:10:33.813 --> 00:10:35.815
You foolish man.

00:10:35.815 --> 00:10:39.652
You make me and Dumas suffer
in place of your brother,

00:10:39.652 --> 00:10:41.517
but what does that get you?

00:10:42.422 --> 00:10:44.357
Come on, Dumas!

00:10:44.357 --> 00:10:46.450
Dumas is my precious son!

00:10:50.930 --> 00:10:55.368
Father, please don't hit
Mother! Don't hit her!

00:10:55.368 --> 00:10:58.738
I won't come see Mother anymore!
I won't come see her!

00:10:58.738 --> 00:11:01.107
Stop! Stop!

00:11:01.107 --> 00:11:03.667
Stop!

00:11:31.137 --> 00:11:33.105
Dumas.

00:11:35.942 --> 00:11:38.478
You are my son.

00:11:38.478 --> 00:11:42.574
As my son, you will fulfill
my wishes, won't you?

00:11:43.249 --> 00:11:46.013
I want you to find Tina's soul.

00:11:46.452 --> 00:11:48.010
Tina?

00:11:48.187 --> 00:11:51.588
That is your older sister, Tina.

00:12:04.604 --> 00:12:07.038
In order to look for you,

00:12:07.573 --> 00:12:10.337
my father made my body smaller.

00:12:11.244 --> 00:12:13.769
I can no longer return
to my original body.

00:12:15.615 --> 00:12:17.950
But I wasn't sad.

00:12:17.950 --> 00:12:22.011
You were here on this planet, and it
made me feel just a little closer to you.

00:12:26.726 --> 00:12:29.820
Mother has passed away.

00:12:32.231 --> 00:12:34.133
In this body of yours,

00:12:34.133 --> 00:12:37.034
I knew there used to be a soul.

00:12:37.403 --> 00:12:40.031
I imagined what it must
have been like back then.

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:42.375
What kind of voice did you have,

00:12:42.375 --> 00:12:46.209
what kind of smile would
appear on that beautiful face?

00:12:47.814 --> 00:12:52.444
How gently would those
white hands embrace me?

00:12:53.853 --> 00:12:55.922
Do you understand, Big Sister?

00:12:55.922 --> 00:12:57.924
These feelings?

00:12:57.924 --> 00:13:00.126
I've always dreamed about that.

00:13:00.126 --> 00:13:03.687
When I left this ocean floor, I
wandered about on the ground above.

00:13:04.330 --> 00:13:08.501
Looking for the scientists from
Greecia who had come to this planet,

00:13:08.501 --> 00:13:11.061
in order to return you
to your original form.

00:13:12.438 --> 00:13:15.999
That was my reason for living.

00:13:20.246 --> 00:13:24.917
Big Sister! I beg of you.
Please go back!

00:13:24.917 --> 00:13:27.820
I will not let you become a weapon!

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:30.890
I would never hand
you over to my father!

00:13:30.890 --> 00:13:34.494
For your sake, I would do anything!

00:13:34.494 --> 00:13:36.485
I don't even need my life!

00:13:40.133 --> 00:13:42.397
Big Sister...

00:13:43.302 --> 00:13:47.238
Dumas... My poor little brother.

00:13:48.107 --> 00:13:50.575
You've been all alone, too.

00:13:53.613 --> 00:13:56.115
But Tina is dead, Dumas.

00:13:56.115 --> 00:13:59.243
I cannot go back to being Tina.

00:14:00.086 --> 00:14:01.888
I'm sorry.

00:14:01.888 --> 00:14:04.190
Big Sister, don't worry.

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:07.226
The transference device
has already been completed.

00:14:07.226 --> 00:14:09.217
You can go back to being Tina.

00:14:11.497 --> 00:14:14.100
That is not the point.

00:14:14.100 --> 00:14:16.435
I am Helga.

00:14:16.435 --> 00:14:20.166
And I will continue to go on
living my life as Helga.

00:14:22.141 --> 00:14:25.508
Are you saying you're going to
live in that unseemly form?

00:14:26.145 --> 00:14:30.309
Your real form is that of Tina.

00:14:31.551 --> 00:14:34.420
Dumas... Poor Dumas.

00:14:34.420 --> 00:14:39.414
If I had been able to embrace you
as Tina, I would have been so happy.

00:14:39.859 --> 00:14:44.387
But that is something I
cannot do anymore, Dumas.

00:14:49.235 --> 00:14:50.634
Even though...

00:14:52.972 --> 00:14:55.141
Even though I'm asking you like this...

00:14:55.141 --> 00:14:58.144
You would...
Listen to me!

00:14:58.144 --> 00:15:00.713
I'm going to turn you back
into Tina no matter what!

00:15:00.713 --> 00:15:03.482
It doesn't matter how much
you try to refuse!

00:15:03.482 --> 00:15:05.950
I'll make you my Tina!

00:15:08.421 --> 00:15:10.116
Lord Dumas.

00:15:10.389 --> 00:15:13.620
Lord Gueroca is asking that
you bring Princess Tina to him.

00:15:23.369 --> 00:15:25.360
Tina.

00:15:45.224 --> 00:15:46.919
It's a dead end.

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:50.320
We can't get any farther like this!

00:15:54.100 --> 00:15:56.227
T-This is...

00:16:01.974 --> 00:16:03.942
Yeah.

00:16:04.110 --> 00:16:06.772
It's a spaceship from Greecia!

00:16:12.785 --> 00:16:14.582
This is?!

00:16:15.521 --> 00:16:17.318
What's that?!

00:16:25.431 --> 00:16:29.231
There's wind coming out. Do you
think we can get in from here?

00:16:32.071 --> 00:16:36.201
Tina, it's good to see you back.

00:16:36.575 --> 00:16:39.100
It's good to see you back!

00:16:43.382 --> 00:16:47.353
The wounds on my body have also
healed as a result of proper care.

00:16:47.353 --> 00:16:51.524
I will finally be able
to go back to Greecia.

00:16:51.524 --> 00:16:54.360
During the thirteen years
that I spent here,

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:57.096
I never for a moment
forget about revenge.

00:16:57.096 --> 00:16:59.530
Revenge against my
older brother, Titus.

00:16:59.932 --> 00:17:03.102
You bring unhappiness to
everyone around you.

00:17:03.102 --> 00:17:05.866
All for the sake of
your selfish desires.

00:17:06.105 --> 00:17:09.408
You don't love Mother or Dumas.

00:17:09.408 --> 00:17:14.038
A person who can't love
cannot be the king of Greecia!

00:17:15.548 --> 00:17:19.314
I will not do anything you tell me to!

00:17:21.787 --> 00:17:26.025
All of this is the result of the sins
committed by your own father.

00:17:26.025 --> 00:17:29.017
If you want to blame someone,
blame your father!

00:17:29.261 --> 00:17:31.923
My son, Dumas!

00:17:33.966 --> 00:17:36.366
The time has come at last!

00:17:36.569 --> 00:17:39.271
Prepare for the resurrection of Tina!

00:17:39.271 --> 00:17:44.299
And then we will return to
our native world of Greecia!

00:18:03.596 --> 00:18:05.393
Let's go!

00:18:08.334 --> 00:18:11.428
This was Mother's room.

00:18:14.840 --> 00:18:16.330
Mother...

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:20.311
I apologize for speaking
so harshly before.

00:18:21.747 --> 00:18:23.416
But, Big Sister,

00:18:23.416 --> 00:18:27.250
I believe that you will definitely
come to understand my feelings.

00:18:41.167 --> 00:18:42.601
Hesma!

00:18:42.601 --> 00:18:44.762
Hurry and make the improvements
to the control mechanism!

00:18:45.504 --> 00:18:50.134
If you cooperate with me,
I will also help you.

00:18:55.548 --> 00:18:59.484
KURIL ISLAND

00:19:03.289 --> 00:19:05.191
Cooks?

00:19:05.191 --> 00:19:08.092
Cooks, we should get going.

00:19:10.429 --> 00:19:13.265
A number of boats have
been coming and going.

00:19:13.265 --> 00:19:15.256
What's the matter?

00:19:16.335 --> 00:19:21.136
What was it that I wanted to
know about the Children of Befort?

00:19:23.042 --> 00:19:27.240
He knew what my grandfather
was like when he was young.

00:19:28.280 --> 00:19:31.215
It was almost as if he'd
seen him yesterday.

00:19:34.220 --> 00:19:38.486
At that time, for just a second,
it felt like I had met my grandfather.

00:19:39.091 --> 00:19:42.754
I was... happy.

00:19:44.797 --> 00:19:46.458
Cooks.

00:19:47.666 --> 00:19:49.835
Okay! We're getting in there!

00:19:49.835 --> 00:19:53.405
Alice! It's the place those children
were investigating, Kuril Island!

00:19:53.405 --> 00:19:55.896
We're going to find out what the
connection is to the Ged Group!

00:20:01.881 --> 00:20:04.111
It's more overgrown than
I would have thought.

00:20:05.317 --> 00:20:07.808
What do you think that is?

00:20:17.229 --> 00:20:19.595
Look, Alice!

00:20:40.519 --> 00:20:44.356
The exterior is a little bit different,
but it's our transference device.

00:20:44.356 --> 00:20:47.326
It was probably a piece of
the Out Zone.

00:20:47.326 --> 00:20:50.729
At the same time we transfer our souls,
something that should have oxidized

00:20:50.729 --> 00:20:53.198
was left behind instead,
and didn't disappear.

00:20:53.198 --> 00:20:57.469
If we destroy something that big,
people's lives will be put in danger.

00:20:57.469 --> 00:21:00.239
Let's look for the piece first, Aghi.

00:21:00.239 --> 00:21:01.807
Everything in the Ketplaque
Island research center

00:21:01.807 --> 00:21:04.469
had already been transferred
so there was nothing there.

00:21:08.147 --> 00:21:09.978
Palza.

00:21:10.382 --> 00:21:12.384
Isn't it strange?

00:21:12.384 --> 00:21:14.987
Even though we separated
such a long time ago,

00:21:14.987 --> 00:21:17.683
it's like we're still
connected somehow.

00:21:19.291 --> 00:21:21.393
Gherta Hawksbee.

00:21:21.393 --> 00:21:23.495
She's a physicist.

00:21:23.495 --> 00:21:25.698
She was probably
influenced by Rugen.

00:21:25.698 --> 00:21:29.964
Besides, in order to extract
the code you need x-rays.

00:21:30.402 --> 00:21:34.202
If Palza hadn't discovered x-rays...

00:21:35.107 --> 00:21:37.098
Let's go, Soreto.

00:21:42.815 --> 00:21:45.841
You can't run away from me.

00:22:00.566 --> 00:22:02.935
I'll tell you one thing.

00:22:02.935 --> 00:22:06.962
It's you who is one of them.

00:22:13.712 --> 00:22:19.014
He knows me.
The me that I don't know.

00:22:36.235 --> 00:22:46.042
At the bottom of the deep, clear sea
fukaku fukaku sukitooru umi no soko ni

00:22:46.311 --> 00:22:56.155
A small flower is resting
chiisana hana madoronderu

00:22:56.155 --> 00:23:00.888
The melody of a gentle wind
amayaka na kaze no shirabe

00:23:00.926 --> 00:23:05.761
Passes through a rainbow
niji wo kuguri

00:23:06.165 --> 00:23:15.301
The fish are playing in the sky
sakanatachi wa sora ni asobu

00:23:15.441 --> 00:23:20.479
Everyone plays the music of love
dare mo ga ai wo kanaderu

00:23:20.479 --> 00:23:25.751
A warm light came down
atatakana hikari futteta

00:23:25.751 --> 00:23:30.154
(A gaze) That gaze
(manazashi wa) sono manazashi wa

00:23:30.189 --> 00:23:34.493
Is unbound and becomes full
hodokete michiteku

00:23:34.493 --> 00:23:39.362
Embraced by water
mizu ni dakare
